<description>&lt;p&gt;Iran has escalated rhetoric, saying the United States is not serious about talks, while the United States warned Baghdad it will strike Iraqi militias that join the Iran war and Iran-backed groups have agreed to disarm by June 2027. Iraq’s closure of the Iran border crossing has sparked protests and turned the Al-Sheeb crossing into a contested corridor, while security forces raided the home of the Maysan provincial council chief for defying the closure. Oil exports have returned to pre-war levels and a vessel caught fire off the Al-Faw coast, prompting UK and US officials to address missing families at the UN Security Council. The conflict produced 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/liveblog/2026/10/27/iran-war-live-iran-says-us-not-serious-on-talks-ship-on-fire-off-iraq?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;VOA - Voice of America English News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxQLUt3d2RTRTBHNXNrdzVmSFR2VWZmSlBHSDdJSDVydklCQXdKNUh1OTNCLWdwZjJEX01oMWpOaVEteFdKbTRUZ2t4dW41cFplS0ZKY1RhdkEwNWtPb2o0MWticEpDRlQ2bm1aMUVCcE12UkpYeTVuZThEMjdBWGQwNGpkczhPMXpZSUs0MW8xY3NzQlgxTkk3aGtyVEhuMm05T3c?oc=5&quot;&gt;Upstream Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiQkFVX3lxTE5jdDI1cWd0dmFpX0Z3QUwwQ19MeS1MVThoZEZmZHR4U1RYcFhVVnpldFB3Rkd0TWp4Y0lualpYMk1NQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;الحرة&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYkFVX3lxTE5UY1ZCeGRMckRVZ3hBSnk2SXBHYmtIOGp3dVJaeVhaR3dQdWw3RmxUY2ViSm5kemtWNk9wUzBFcldKTmhtd0NldXI5U1g4OVBTUzBzWGFHdmFLdzYxeFB5UWxn?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN Media&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxPc2hNVFlGZlAtbGJDLTNwYkZCamFrbzlPenFFOGJKc2tL